 {:id "adr-2607078100-club-shinshi-receive-only-usdc-rail-creator-payout-deferred"
  :title "ADR-2607078100: club-shinshi V1 monetization -- receive-only USDC rail (buyer -> gftd), creator payout deferred"
  :status "implemented"
  :doc_type "adr"
  :topic "shinshi-crypto-payout-rail"
  :authoritative true
  :last_verified "2026-07-08"
  :authoritative_for
  ["decision: club-shinshi's V1 crypto monetization is receive-only (buyer -> gftd,
    one-directional, gftd as ordinary merchant) -- NOT creator payout. Creator payout
    (buyer -> gftd -> creator) is explicitly deferred to a future ADR/task"
   "reason for the narrowing: a code-level check of the existing etzhayyim ERC-4337
    actor infra (EtzhayyimActorRegistry.sol, EtzhayyimPaymaster.sol) found it unsafe to
    build creator payout on yet -- registry activate() has no access control (DID
    front-running/hijack), paymaster allowlist doesn't enforce function selector or
    recipient (contradicts its own README policy), and the deployed self-custody wallet
    pair lives on etzhayyim's private single-sealer chain, not the public Base L2 the
    payments policy targets. Paymaster itself is undeployed/unaudited stub v0.0.0"
   "implementation: 0008_crypto_pay.sql (pay_run ledger) + shinshi.worker.payments
    (buyer-facing quote/claim/status) + shinshi.worker.d1-gateway ops
    (list_pending_pay_runs, confirm_pay_run) + bb.edn/tools/verify-payments.clj --
    club-shinshi's OWN separate treasury address, never local-murakumo's (ADR-2607052100
    commingling finding applies to receive-only rails too)"
   "landed: jk-luxury/club-shinshi#6, merge commit d7f83c2a2e9d8e73afbf53531ba43693c594b9c3
    (2026-07-08). Amendment: treasury.core is VENDORED at
    60-apps/.../cljs/src/treasury/core.cljc (pinned kotoba-lang/treasury commit
    e87e1299fe8562c98ef4b6044a1ad025dd493258), not a live cross-repo source-path --
    the original relative-sibling-path approach broke CI (club-shinshi's CI and deploy
    both check out this repo alone, not the full west workspace). Re-verified green in a
    standalone clone matching CI's checkout shape, then on CI itself, before merging"
   "SHINSHI_TREASURY_ADDR is unset by default -- no real wallet provisioned, no mainnet
    transaction, no legal/compliance certification performed"]
